DESCRIPTION:Fixed 2 Move invites you to an outstanding estate sale in New 
 Hope\, PA\, featuring a sophisticated selection of fine furniture\, uniqu
 e seating\, and curated home decor. Highlights include statement accent s
 eating such as French country style balloon canopy chairs upholstered in 
 striking cowhide-pattern fabric and premium leather\, a vintage Chesterfi
 eld-style sofa in gold damask with deep button tufting\, and elegant acce
 nt tables featuring hand-painted details and marble tops on ornate wrough
 t iron bases.\nArt and decor enthusiasts will find a diverse collection o
 f framed wall art\, ranging from vintage movie prints and antique framed 
 artworks to contemporary abstract portraits featuring gold leaf accents. 
 The sale also includes high-end decorative textiles\, featuring intricate
  beaded and metallic throw pillows\, alongside a large muted sage green t
 raditional area rug with detailed floral scrolling.\nWe accept major cred
 it cards as well as cash\, Venmo and Cashapp. Join us in New Hope for thi
 s exceptional shopping event.
